@startuml
' Render with: plantuml -tsvg docs/fig_4_3_activity_guardrails.puml

title Activity: Daily Scoring with Guardrails

start
:Scheduler triggers job;
:Fetch macro & sentiment from APIs;
:Preprocess & join features;
:Predict risk with model;
:Compute SHAP explanations;

if (G-01 Freshness \n last_ingest_hours > 24?) then (Yes)
  :Raise DATA_STALE alert;
  :Log to Audit;
else (No)
  :Proceed;
endif

if (G-02 Sparse news \n sentiment_n < 15?) then (Yes)
  :Flag low-confidence prediction;
  :Raise ALERT_SENTIMENT_SHOCK (if z-score spike);
  :Log to Audit;
else (No)
  :Proceed;
endif

:Publish results to Dashboard;
stop

@enduml
